  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Create a new instance of the <a href=\"BeanFactoryDataSourceLookup.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jdbc.datasource.lookup\"><code>BeanFactoryDataSourceLookup</code></a> class.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的 <a href=\"BeanFactoryDataSourceLookup.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jdbc.datasource.lookup\"><code>BeanFactoryDataSourceLookup</code></a> 类实例。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Use of this constructor is redundant if this object is being created\nby a Spring IoC container, as the supplied <a href=\"../../../beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> will be\nreplaced by the <a href=\"../../../beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> that creates it (c.f. the\n<a href=\"../../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactoryAware</code></a> contract). So only use this constructor if you\nare using this class outside the context of a Spring IoC container.",
      "translation": "如果此对象是由 Spring IoC 容器创建的，则使用此构造函数是多余的，因为提供的 <a href=\"../../../beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> 将被创建它的 <a href=\"../../../beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> 替换（参见 <a href=\"../../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactoryAware</code></a> 契约）。因此，仅在不在 Spring IoC 容器上下文中使用此类时，才使用此构造函数。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Will lookup Spring managed beans identified by bean name,\nexpecting them to be of type <code>javax.sql.DataSource</code>.",
      "translation": "将查找通过 bean 名称标识的 Spring 托管 Bean，并期望其类型为 `<code>javax.sql.DataSource</code>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The BeanFactory to access must be set via <code>setBeanFactory</code>.",
      "translation": "要访问的 BeanFactory 必须通过<code>setBeanFactory</code>设置。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"DataSourceLookup.html#getDataSource(java.lang.String)\">DataSourceLookup</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"DataSourceLookup.html#getDataSource(java.lang.String)\">DataSourceLookup</a></code></span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Retrieve the DataSource identified by the given name.",
      "translation": "获取给定名称的 DataSource。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"DataSourceLookup.html#getDataSource(java.lang.String)\">getDataSource</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"DataSourceLookup.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.jdbc.datasource.lookup\">DataSourceLookup</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"DataSourceLookup.html#getDataSource(java.lang.String)\">getDataSource</a></code>` 接口 `<code><a href=\"DataSourceLookup.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.jdbc.datasource.lookup\">DataSourceLookup</a></code>` 中",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>beanFactory</code> - the bean factory to be used to lookup <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/javax/sql/DataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql\"><code>DataSources</code></a>",
      "translation": "<code>beanFactory</code> - 用于查找 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/javax/sql/DataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql\"><code>DataSources</code></a> 的 BeanFactory",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"DataSourceLookupFailureException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jdbc.datasource.lookup\">DataSourceLookupFailureException</a></code> - if the lookup failed",
      "translation": "<code><a href=\"DataSourceLookupFailureException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jdbc.datasource.lookup\">DataSourceLookupFailureException</a></code> - 如果查找失败",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Invoked after the population of normal bean properties\nbut before an initialization callback such as\n<a href=\"../../../beans/factory/InitializingBean.html#afterPropertiesSet()\"><code>InitializingBean.afterPropertiesSet()</code></a> or a custom init-method.",
      "translation": "在普通 Bean 属性填充之后，但在初始化回调（例如 <a href=\"../../../beans/factory/InitializingBean.html#afterPropertiesSet()\"><code>InitializingBean.afterPropertiesSet()</code></a>）或自定义 init-method 之前调用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html#setBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.BeanFactory)\">BeanFactoryAware</a></code></span>",
